              "role": "user",
              "content": "Content Type: {{ $node['Content Request Validator'].json['content_type'] }}\nPlatforms: {{ $node['Content Request Validator'].json['platforms'].join(', ') }}\nTarget Audience: {{ $node['Content Request Validator'].json['target_audience'] }}\n\nGenerated Content:\n{{ $json.choices ? $json.choices[0].message.content : $json.message || 'No content generated' }}\n\nOptimize this content for:\n1. SEO performance\n2. Engagement metrics\n3. Platform-specific best practices\n4. Audience targeting\n5. Call-to-action effectiveness\n\nProvide specific, actionable optimization recommendations."
